ACKNOWLEDGMENTS

This project was inspired by the need to test hardware-dependent applications
without requiring physical devices. Special thanks to the .NET and WPF communities
for providing excellent frameworks and documentation.

The barcode check digit calculation algorithm is based on the GS1 standard
specification for EAN/UPC barcodes.

The scale output format (ST,GS protocol) is compatible with common industrial
weighing scales from manufacturers including AND, Ohaus, and CAS.
